## Feature 4 Complete: GitHub Issue and PR Templates

### Files Created

1. `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md`
   - Bug report template with fields for environment, reproduction steps, expected/actual behavior
   - Includes sections for workflow YAML and logs (collapsible)
   - Pre-configured with bug label

2. `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.md`
   - Feature request template with problem statement, proposed solution, example usage
   - Includes contribution willingness checkbox
   - Pre-configured with enhancement label

3. `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml`
   - Enables blank issues for flexibility
   - Adds contact links to documentation and discussions

4. `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`
   - PR template with description, related issue, type of change
   - Testing checklist (unit tests, linter, manual testing)
   - Code review checklist

### Notes
- All templates are tailored for an AI workflow orchestration tool
- Templates include workflow YAML code blocks where applicable
- Used collapsible sections for logs/output to keep issues clean
